<title>USA: Struthers in talks with possible investors.</title>
<headline>Struthers in talks with possible investors.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Struthers Industries Inc Tuesday said it is in final talks with potential investors over a plan to strengthen the company's finances.</p>
<p>Renewed financial strength would enable the company to again move forward with its business plan toward industry leadership in advanced utility automation, it said.</p>
<p>Struthers is a telecommunications company focused on automation and data service delivery via wireless technology.</p>
</text>
